OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after 20 homes evacuated
OL,4,Ain grenade alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested after about
OL,7,F20 homes were evacuated following
OL,8,Freports of a grenade at a property in
OL,9,FGlossop.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to an address in Queen Street in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of Friday.
OL,15,FThe force said residents from about 20
OL,16,Fhomes were told to leave before the
OL,17,FArmy's explosive Ordnance Division
OL,18,Fattended and found the device was not a
OL,19,Frisk. All residents have since been
OL,20,Fallowed back.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
