OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after 20 homes evacuated
OL,4,Ain grenade alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne man was arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fbeing in possession of a prohibited
OL,8,Fweapon, officers said, while three
OL,9,Fother men were detained on suspicion of
OL,10,Fbeing concerned in the supply of Class
OL,11,FA drugs.
